          "center_error": 0.176,
          "text": "Measures for the Administration of Domestic\nProject Operations of CCECC FUZHOU SURVEY & DESIGN INSTITUTE CO."
        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "role": "chapter_heading",
          "source_block": 3,
          "candidate_block": 3,
          "candidate_line_count": 1,
          "center_error": 0.111,
          "text": "Chapter 1 General Provisions"
        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "role": "article_text",
          "source_block": 4,
          "candidate_block": 4,
          "candidate_line_count": 7,
          "center_error": 17.998,
          "text": "Article 1 In accordance with the Guiding Opinions on High­Quality Business\nOperations of the Joint­Stock Company, and in conjunction with the relevant\nrequirements of the Group Company's Implementation Rules for High­Quality\nBusiness Operations (Trial) (Zhongtu Business [2024] No. 341), these Measures\nare hereby formulated to comprehensively improve the quality of project\noperations, effectively manage the Company's domestic business operations,\nand standardize business procedures and workflows."
        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "role": "article_text",
          "source_block": 8,
          "candidate_block": 5,
          "candidate_line_count": 3,
          "center_error": 16.539,
          "text": "Article 2 Projects in these Measures refer to various types of the Company's\nbusiness operations undertaken through direct entrustment or bidding, such as\nconsulting, survey, design, supervision, and engineering general contracting."
        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "role": "article_text",
          "source_block": 10,
          "candidate_block": 6,
          "candidate_line_count": 3,
          "center_error": 21.804,
          "text": "Article 3 In principle, business undertaking work shall follow the procedure\nof project evaluation first, then application for approval, and finally contract\nsigning."
        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "role": "article_text",
          "source_block": 12,
          "candidate_block": 7,
          "candidate_line_count": 8,
          "center_error": 16.179,
          "text": "Article 4 When carrying out project business undertaking work, factors such\nas the Company's development strategy, business direction, responsibility cost,\nproduction and technical capabilities, and current status shall be comprehensively\nconsidered, and in accordance with the procedural provisions of these Measures,\nthe work in links such as information tracking, project evaluation and application,\nbid document preparation and review, contract negotiation, contract review and\nsigning, owner services during project implementation, and project return visits\nshall be completed."
        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "role": "chapter_heading",
          "source_block": 17,
          "candidate_block": 8,
          "candidate_line_count": 1,
          "center_error": 0.127,
          "text": "Chapter 2 Relevant Responsibilities"
        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "role": "article_text",
          "source_block": 18,
          "candidate_block": 9,
          "candidate_line_count": 3,
          "center_error": 35.201,
          "text": "Article 5 The Business Development Department is the management\ndepartment for the Company's domestic project business operations and is\nresponsible for the layout and expansion of the institute's business market."
        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "role": "article_text",
          "source_block": 20,
          "candidate_block": 10,
          "candidate_line_count": 2,
          "center_error": 16.957,
          "text": "Article 6 The relevant personnel involved in project business operations and\ntheir main responsibilities are shown in Table 1:"
        },
        {
